        "Charles L. Bennett",
        "David N. Spergel",
        "Lyman A. Page Jr."
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "WMAP made precision cosmology into a quantitative observational science through a definitive full-sky map of the microwave background.",
        "attribution": "These names represent leadership in experiment, analysis, and cosmological interpretation, though the achievement was necessarily a broad team effort.",
        "maturity": "Its principal cosmological conclusions have been tested by subsequent measurements and remain foundational.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Attribution among the mission, its analysis team, and preceding CMB experiments needs close review."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
