        "attribution": "Tajima supplied the seminal concept, with Malka and Leemans among the leading experimental developers.",
        "maturity": "Key acceleration principles are robustly demonstrated and beam quality has advanced substantially.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Its ultimate scientific and accelerator-system impact is still developing."
        ]
      }
